    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλω</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλομαι</span></b> , only pres., impf., and
