				3.1.106
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλοντι</span>) :
				impf.
			3pl.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλοντο</span>”
